(5934590, 865198, 106910, '<td valign="top">I had predicted there were going to be photos with a cliche title like "Waiting for the sunrise" but I was not expecting anything as wonderful as this. The varying tones, the mist, the composition... AND - a human subject that makes the entire photo have an emotion that others simply lack. Beautiful - 10.</td>', 'I had predicted there were going to be photos with a cliche title like "Waiting for the sunrise" but I was not expecting anything as wonderful as this. The varying tones, the mist, the composition... AND - a human subject that makes the entire photo have an emotion that others simply lack. Beautiful - 10.', '2010-04-07 02:53:47.000000', NULL, 1),
