(5937311, 864223, 60495, '<td valign="top">I think the idea of the starting line was very good but shooting the back side just does not do the idea justice. To me if the shot was from the front with the runners in the starting block stance it would have worked better and likely scored better.</td>', 'I think the idea of the starting line was very good but shooting the back side just does not do the idea justice. To me if the shot was from the front with the runners in the starting block stance it would have worked better and likely scored better.', '2010-04-08 11:16:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5937316, 865093, 60495, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done, this shot will likely be keepsake for the little girl to look back on, and it really fits the challenge topic nicely as well.</td>', 'Very nicely done, this shot will likely be keepsake for the little girl to look back on, and it really fits the challenge topic nicely as well.', '2010-04-08 11:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5937320, 864595, 60495, '<td valign="top">I do not like the way the corsage is partially cut off and the way the wood comes out of his head, maybe moving him slightly would have helped but overall I just do not care for the setting, the setting just does not add anything positive for the shot but rather becomes a distraction.<br/> <br/>And is it just me or is waiting for your bride on a play ground just a little bit odd....lol. Sorry I could not help myself! <br/> <br/>Hope the information helps, good luck in the challenge, 5</td>', 'I do not like the way the corsage is partially cut off and the way the wood comes out of his head, maybe moving him slightly would have helped but overall I just do not care for the setting, the setting just does not add anything positive for the shot but rather becomes a distraction. And is it just me or is waiting for your bride on a play ground just a little bit odd....lol. Sorry I could not help myself!  Hope the information helps, good luck in the challenge, 5', '2010-04-08 11:42:34.000000', NULL, 1),
