(5939108, 865229, 68573, '<td valign="top">A truly ''waiting'' image I can immediately relate to. Most of the entries are smart titled to fit it the challenge</td>', 'A truly ''waiting'' image I can immediately relate to. Most of the entries are smart titled to fit it the challenge', '2010-04-10 00:19:25.000000', NULL, 1),
