(5945206, 865720, 28742, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Lad:</b></div><hr/><i> 5th place I think </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Yeah, me too. ;-) Congrats Wendy! A solid image! Made your portfolio page, too.</td>', 'Originally posted by Lad: 5th place I think  Yeah, me too. ;-) Congrats Wendy! A solid image! Made your portfolio page, too.', '2010-04-14 03:05:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(5945217, 864658, 94437, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by yinanshi:</b></div><hr/><i> superb image.<br/> <br/>I''m a little confused.  you''ve used aperture 3.5 with a f4.0 lens? is it a typo?<br/>(sorry, maybe a stupid question) :) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Good pickup there... I used a new 150mm Sigma 2.8 lens I hadn''t added to my list of lenses.<br/>Glad you liked my image.<br/> <br/>I dont think this guy was that hard up on his luck, he had new boots, a nice jacket and could afford cigarettes, it was just a little PP that made him look a bit hard up<br/> <br/>Cheers<br/>Craig<br/></td>', 'Originally posted by yinanshi: superb image. I''m a little confused.  you''ve used aperture 3.5 with a f4.0 lens? is it a typo?(sorry, maybe a stupid question) :)   Good pickup there... I used a new 150mm Sigma 2.8 lens I hadn''t added to my list of lenses.Glad you liked my image. I dont think this guy was that hard up on his luck, he had new boots, a nice jacket and could afford cigarettes, it was just a little PP that made him look a bit hard up CheersCraig', '2010-04-14 03:13:27.000000', NULL, 0),
