(5945449, 865463, 86218, '<td valign="top">I recall this and it is a really striking pick I liked it but voted 6 on it. The white socks on left really takes it away for me - nothing you could do about it. Need similar type sock paterns - Still a great take and well seen</td>', 'I recall this and it is a really striking pick I liked it but voted 6 on it. The white socks on left really takes it away for me - nothing you could do about it. Need similar type sock paterns - Still a great take and well seen', '2010-04-14 05:51:00.000000', NULL, 0),
