(5945502, 865198, 64086, '<td valign="top">Great shot Bryan! Just a warm up. Go team!</td>', 'Great shot Bryan! Just a warm up. Go team!', '2010-04-14 06:38:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(5945505, 865256, 115345, '<td valign="top">I didn''t vote in that challenge and anyway my ratings are often the opposite of the mainstream so probably not much use to you but I like your image.  I am no expert either so take this all with suitable doses of salt...<br/> <br/>For me it has a sense of mood and generally good overall composition.  I like the tonal range and narrow depth of field - they suit the composition and feel.<br/> <br/>The only negatives I would raise are the chopped off (and therefore unresolved) bits of stuff in the bottom right foreground and mid right that are a little distracting (to me).<br/> <br/>I would have rated it more than the ~4.7 and 97/133 you got - around 6-7 on my warped scale.<br/> <br/>That is probably your downfall then... if I like it, many others won''t :(<br/> <br/></td>', 'I didn''t vote in that challenge and anyway my ratings are often the opposite of the mainstream so probably not much use to you but I like your image.  I am no expert either so take this all with suitable doses of salt... For me it has a sense of mood and generally good overall composition.  I like the tonal range and narrow depth of field - they suit the composition and feel. The only negatives I would raise are the chopped off (and therefore unresolved) bits of stuff in the bottom right foreground and mid right that are a little distracting (to me). I would have rated it more than the ~4.7 and 97/133 you got - around 6-7 on my warped scale. That is probably your downfall then... if I like it, many others won''t :( ', '2010-04-14 06:42:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(5945519, 865535, 67363, '<td valign="top">He is so cute! Great capture! Congrats on a blue.</td>', 'He is so cute! Great capture! Congrats on a blue.', '2010-04-14 07:05:03.000000', NULL, 0),
