(5945537, 865723, 86322, '<td valign="top">Wow, I can''t believe the place for this photo... Actually I can, anything expected here in dpc. I think this was one of the most amazing photos in this challenge. A great example of use of soft focus and bw conversion. It was one of my few 10. Pls wear this place with honor for the people that really enjoyed it.</td>', 'Wow, I can''t believe the place for this photo... Actually I can, anything expected here in dpc. I think this was one of the most amazing photos in this challenge. A great example of use of soft focus and bw conversion. It was one of my few 10. Pls wear this place with honor for the people that really enjoyed it.', '2010-04-14 07:38:59.000000', NULL, 0),
