(5945797, 864658, 3936, '<td valign="top">I think you did an excellent job of using the empty benches to isolate your subject and bring the proper mood to this image.  Too many people would have been tempted to crop tightly to the man.  The processing and lighting fit very well here, giving the image a harsher, colder feel.  Very nice work, and congratulations on a very well deserved riboon.</td>', 'I think you did an excellent job of using the empty benches to isolate your subject and bring the proper mood to this image.  Too many people would have been tempted to crop tightly to the man.  The processing and lighting fit very well here, giving the image a harsher, colder feel.  Very nice work, and congratulations on a very well deserved riboon.', '2010-04-14 10:32:26.000000', NULL, 0),
