(5945877, 865093, 108584, '<td valign="top">Oh my God!!! Im thrilled! A PB wayyyy ahead of the average score I had. Plus this image helped me get 2 of my last years resolutions: be in the top 10 and have an average of 6+, Im only missing one that is to have more than 20 comments in one image, maybe I could still get it. Thanks so much for the comments and the great votes. Now the hard thing would be to keep climbing!</td>', 'Oh my God!!! Im thrilled! A PB wayyyy ahead of the average score I had. Plus this image helped me get 2 of my last years resolutions: be in the top 10 and have an average of 6+, Im only missing one that is to have more than 20 comments in one image, maybe I could still get it. Thanks so much for the comments and the great votes. Now the hard thing would be to keep climbing!', '2010-04-14 11:11:41.000000', NULL, 0),
